unRAR license restriction（上游要求的声明，须保留在文档与源码注释中）
--------------------------------------------------------------------

  The decompression engine for RAR archives was developed using
  source code of unRAR program. All copyrights to original unRAR
  code are owned by Alexander Roshal.

  The license for original unRAR code has the following
  restriction:

    The unRAR sources cannot be used to re-create the RAR
    compression algorithm, which is proprietary. Distribution of
    modified unRAR sources in separate form or as a part of other
    software is permitted, provided that it is clearly stated in
    the documentation and source comments that the code may not be
    used to develop a RAR (WinRAR) compatible archiver.

  【中文说明】RAR 解压引擎源自 unRAR，版权归 Alexander Roshal。
  不得使用该部分代码重新实现专有的 RAR 压缩算法；分发修改后的
  unRAR 代码（单独或并入其他软件）时，必须在文档与源码注释中
  明确声明：该代码不得用于开发 RAR（WinRAR）兼容的归档工具。
  本项目仅调用 7-Zip 提供 RAR 解压能力，未实现、也不得据本项目
  代码实现 RAR 兼容归档器。

